# cabin_lit_stove: the wood stove inside, seen through the left bank's
# middle pane at night: an ink stove, its pipe up to the ceiling (the
# stovepipe on the roof is its other end), and its fire's flicker (the fire
# cycle, 20: rust, pink, cream, never gold). The anchor, 0,0, is at_stove.
C 0  L 0,-19  L 0,-18  L 0,-17  L 0,-16  L 0,-15  L 0,-14
      L 0,-13  L 0,-12  L 0,-11  L 0,-10  L 0,-9  L 0,-8
      L -2,-7 2,-7  L -2,-6 -1,-6  L 1,-6 2,-6  L -2,-5  L 0,-5  L 2,-5
      L -2,-4 -1,-4  L 1,-4 2,-4  L -2,-3 2,-3  L -2,-2 2,-2
C 20  L 0,-6  L -1,-5  L 1,-5  L 0,-4
